<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33321" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλά̄-ϊνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of olive-wood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαΐνῳ ἀμφὶ πελέκκῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.612
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στειλειόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.236
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.3.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1177
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>of olive-branches</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέφανος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					31.110
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>of the olive-tree</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλλάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					16.4.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of olive-oil</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>L.</u>
				717
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>of olives</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					24.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.8.3
			</span></i>. (Also spelt 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαίινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					2.678
				</span></i>
			<u>B.</u>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
